00:10:41.555 --> 00:11:47.450
Guide the invitation and password

00:11:47.450 --> 00:12:50.920
Help the owner complete payment

00:12:50.920 --> 00:13:57.320
Recover problems without a duplicate charge

00:13:57.320 --> 00:14:58.100
Hand over the QR and staff routine

00:14:58.100 --> 00:16:57.640
Practise the complete conversation
